10 REM 异步 echo server：单线程事件循环 + 非阻塞 socket，无线程。对照 web_server.sa
20 REM 的同步 accept 循环——这里 accept/recv/send 全走 AWAIT，挂起时事件循环去 poll
30 REM 别的 fd，就绪了再回来。首期异步 I/O 锁定服务端三件套：ACCEPT/RECV/SEND_ASYNC。
40 USE SYS.NET AS N
50 USE SYS.STRING AS S
60 REM 处理一条连接：收一次、原样回写、关闭。整个函数是一个协程，三个 AWAIT 是三个
70 REM 挂起点，其间事件循环可以去干别的。
80 ASYNC SUB serve(conn AS HANDLE AS NET_STREAM) AS VOID
90 DIM request AS STRING AS VAR
100 DIM sent AS NUM AS LONG AS VAR
110 DIM ok AS BOOL AS VAR
120 request = AWAIT N.RECV_ASYNC(conn, 4096)
130 sent = AWAIT N.SEND_ASYNC(conn, request)
140 ok = N.STREAM_CLOSE(conn)
150 RETURN
160 .ENDSUB
170 REM 接受一条连接并交给 serve 处理完。accept 挂起等新连接，来了之后 AWAIT serve
180 REM 把这条连接的收发也走完，然后协程终结。
190 ASYNC SUB accept_and_serve(listener AS HANDLE AS TCP_LISTENER) AS VOID
200 DIM conn AS HANDLE AS NET_STREAM AS VAR
210 conn = AWAIT N.ACCEPT_ASYNC(listener)
220 AWAIT serve(conn)
230 RETURN
240 .ENDSUB
250 SUB main AS PUBLIC AS VOID
260 DIM listener AS HANDLE AS TCP_LISTENER AS VAR
270 DIM ok AS BOOL AS VAR
280 listener = N.TCP_LISTEN("127.0.0.1", 8090, 16)
290 IF listener = NULL THEN
300 PRINT F"listen failed: {N.LAST_ERROR()}"
310 RETURN
320 .ENDIF
330 PRINT F"async echo server on 127.0.0.1:{N.LOCAL_PORT(listener)}"
340 REM SYNC 从普通代码进入协程世界：驱动事件循环直到这一条连接处理完。
350 SYNC accept_and_serve(listener)
360 ok = N.TCP_LISTENER_CLOSE(listener)
370 PRINT "server stopped"
380 .ENDSUB
390 CALL main
400 END
